## Scope limits (never claim beyond)

The catalog reports the ADMISSION state of the library: counts, pins,
contracts, quarantines. It is not verification, not physics quality, not
runtime readiness — every admitted record is status=extracted and every
source is authority=external_assertion, runtime_ready=false. The doc's
license-class column is a bookkeeping label; the verbatim quotes are the
facts.

